WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.521 --> 00:00:09.554
&gt;&gt; Mike: I GILDED HELICOPTERS

00:00:09.555 --> 00:00:10.321
ARE ADORNING TREES ALL OVER THE

00:00:10.322 --> 00:00:13.124
COUNTRY AS THE 2019 WHITE HOUSE

00:00:13.125 --> 00:00:14.559
HISTORICAL ASSOCIATION'S

00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:15.093
CHRISTMAS ORNAMENT.

00:00:15.094 --> 00:00:20.932
DAVID'S FONT HAS THE CONCEPT

00:00:20.933 --> 00:00:24.302
HANGING ON THE TREE.

00:00:24.303 --> 00:00:25.003
&gt;&gt; THIS PRODUCTION LINE IS

00:00:25.004 --> 00:00:26.437
HUMMING AS DOZENS OF EMPLOYEES

00:00:26.438 --> 00:00:29.140
WORK LONG HOURS TO MAKE THIS

00:00:29.141 --> 00:00:29.841
YEAR'S WHITE HOUSE CHRISTMAS

00:00:29.842 --> 00:00:30.375
ORNAMENT.

00:00:30.376 --> 00:00:33.177
&gt;&gt; IT'S EXCITING TO SEE WHAT YOU

00:00:33.178 --> 00:00:34.646
CAN ACCOMPLISH.

00:00:34.647 --> 00:00:37.649
&gt;&gt; DAVID MAKI IS THE PRESIDENT

00:00:37.650 --> 00:00:38.449
OF A SECOND GENERATION OWN

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:41.319
FAMILY BUSINESS IN RHODE ISLAND.

00:00:41.320 --> 00:00:42.620
THEY BEGAN PRODUCING WHITE HOUSE

00:00:42.621 --> 00:00:46.491
THEMED ORNAMENTS IN 1951 AT THE

00:00:46.492 --> 00:00:47.659
REQUEST OF NANCY REAGAN.

00:00:47.660 --> 00:00:48.593
THIS YEAR THEY ARE APPROACHING

00:00:48.594 --> 00:00:50.128
1 MILLION AND COME UP WITH

00:00:50.129 --> 00:00:51.195
TOGETHER BY HAND.

00:00:51.196 --> 00:00:53.097
&gt;&gt; THEY PUT IT TOGETHER USING A

00:00:53.098 --> 00:00:54.766
TAB IN SLOT SYSTEM THAT THEY'VE

00:00:54.767 --> 00:00:57.368
DEVELOPED WITH A PAIR OF PLIERS.

00:00:57.369 --> 00:00:59.470
&gt;&gt; THEY PAY TRIBUTE TO THE

00:00:59.471 --> 00:01:01.773
PRESIDENTS IN SEQUENTIAL ORDER.

00:01:01.774 --> 00:01:05.143
THE FIRST ORNAMENT HONORED

00:01:05.144 --> 00:01:08.446
GEORGE WASHINGTON, AND THE 2008

00:01:08.447 --> 00:01:09.213
BENJAMIN HARRISON ORNAMENT MARKS

00:01:09.214 --> 00:01:12.050
THE FIRST TRADITIONAL CHRISTMAS

00:01:12.051 --> 00:01:13.351
TREE IN THE WHITE HOUSE.

00:01:13.352 --> 00:01:14.819
2019 ORNAMENT IS UNLIKE THE

00:01:14.820 --> 00:01:15.453
REST.

00:01:15.454 --> 00:01:18.256
AT THREE DIMENSIONAL HELICOPTER

00:01:18.257 --> 00:01:18.957
ON THE WHITE HOUSE SOUTH LAWN.

00:01:18.958 --> 00:01:20.525
&gt;&gt; EVERY YEAR IS EXCITING WITH

00:01:20.526 --> 00:01:22.026
THE WHITE HOUSE BUT I THINK THIS

00:01:22.027 --> 00:01:23.394
IS ONE OF THE MOST EXCITING

00:01:23.395 --> 00:01:26.097
BECAUSE IT REALLY PUSHED THAT

00:01:26.098 --> 00:01:26.965
TECHNOLOGY TOWARDS IT.

00:01:26.966 --> 00:01:30.435
&gt;&gt; IT'S A TRIBUTE TO

00:01:30.436 --> 00:01:31.436
PRESIDENT NUMBER 34,

00:01:31.437 --> 00:01:32.003
DWIGHT D. EISENHOWER.

00:01:32.004 --> 00:01:33.237
&gt;&gt; HE WAS FIRST AMERICAN

00:01:33.238 --> 00:01:34.806
PRESIDENT TO USE A HELICOPTER

00:01:34.807 --> 00:01:36.574
FOR PRESIDENTIAL TRAVEL.

00:01:36.575 --> 00:01:39.143
&gt;&gt; AND THE PRESIDENT OF THE

00:01:39.144 --> 00:01:44.315
HISTORICAL -- YOU SEE THAT

00:01:44.316 --> 00:01:45.049
MAJESTIC HELICOPTER FLY IN AND

00:01:45.050 --> 00:01:48.453
LANDED ON THE SOFT LAWN ON THE

00:01:48.454 --> 00:01:49.153
WHITE HOUSE AND THE PRESIDENT

00:01:49.154 --> 00:01:52.591
AND THE FIRST FAMILY DISEMBARK,

